  "pal_park_encounters": [],
  "form_descriptions": [],
  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "flavor_text": "むねの　うもうと　ぬけおちた　はねでつくった　ふくろに　ものを　いれてたかいところから　おとして　あそぶ。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "가슴의 깃털과 떨어진 깃털로 만든 주머니에 물건을 넣고는 높은 곳에서 떨어뜨리며 논다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "會把東西裝在用胸部的絨羽和脫落的羽毛做成的袋子裡，然後從高處往下丟來玩耍。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il aime mettre des objets dans le tablier formé de plumes qui orne son poitrail, avant de les larguer depuis une altitude élevée.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Zum Spaß füllt es seine Schürze aus Brustgefieder und ausgefallenen Federn mit allerlei Dingen, nur um diese von hoch oben wieder fallen zu lassen.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Mete cosas en su bolsa, fabricada con el plumón de su pecho y con plumas mudadas, para luego dejarlas caer desde las alturas por diversión.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Intreccia le piume cadute a quelle del petto per creare un grembiule in cui mettere oggetti, che fa poi precipitare dall’alto.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "It gathers things up in an apron made from shed feathers added to the Pokémon’s chest feathers, then drops those things from high places for fun.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "胸の　羽毛と　抜け落ちた　羽根で作った　袋に　物を　入れて高いところから　落として　遊ぶ。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "用胸部的绒毛和脱落的羽毛做成袋子，然后把东西放进去，并从高处往下丢着玩耍。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Mete cosas en su bolsa, fabricada con el plumón de su pecho y con plumas mudadas, para luego dejarlas caer desde las alturas por diversión.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "むなもとの　ふくろで　エサを　つつみすに　もちかえる。　おおきな　おとのするものを　おとして　よろこぶ。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "가슴팍의 주머니에 먹이를 담아서 둥지로 가져간다. 큰 소리가 나는 물건을 떨어뜨리는 것을 즐긴다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "會用胸口的袋子包住食物，然後帶回巢裡。以弄掉會發出響亮聲音的東西為樂。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Ce Pokémon transporte sa nourriture jusqu’à son nid grâce à son tablier. Il aime larguer des objets qui s’écrasent avec fracas.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Es wickelt Futter in seine Brustschürze und trägt es so heim ins Nest. Liebend gern lässt es Dinge herabfallen, die beim Aufprall Lärm verursachen.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Usa la bolsa del pecho para envolver comida y transportarla a su nido. Le encanta dejar caer objetos que hacen mucho ruido.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Usa il grembiule pettorale per trasportare cibo al nido. Si diverte a far precipitare oggetti che, schiantandosi, fanno un gran fracasso.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Bombirdier uses the apron on its chest to bundle up food, which it carries back to its nest. It enjoys dropping things that make loud noises.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "胸元の　袋で　エサを　包み巣に　持ち帰る。　大きな　音のするものを　落として　喜ぶ。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "会用胸口的袋子包住食物，然后带回巢里。以弄掉会发出响亮声音的东西为乐。",
      "language": {
